course: dictionary
lesson: 1184
title: Brownish and the ending -ish
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Brownish is made of two parts: brown and -ish. The ending -ish means «a bit» or «rather», so brownish means slightly brown, a colour close to brown but not quite. «The Leopard matched the ... colour of the High Veldt to one hair» shows that the colour was close to the land's colour but not exactly the same.
explain: The ending -ish works on other words too: tall becomes tallish, small becomes smallish, green becomes greenish. Each one means a little bit of the word it comes from.
explain: Brownish is often joined to another colour with a hyphen, like brownish-green or brownish-red. The two colours are mixed together. «The Giraffe, the Zebra, the Eland, the Koodoo (kudu) and the Hartebeest were all sandy-yellow-brownish all over» means the animals' coats were a mix of sandy, yellow and brown shades.
fact: Brownish means slightly brown, or a colour close to brown but not quite.
fact: The ending -ish means «a bit» or «rather», as in brownish, greenish and tallish.
fact: «Brownish-green» means green with some brown mixed in.
fact: «The animals were sandy-yellow-brownish all over» describes a mix of three colours in the animals' coats.
fact: Eland, kudu and hartebeest are real African antelopes.
exercise: «Its coat was brownish, not quite brown.» What does brownish mean? | *Slightly brown | Bright blue | Shiny and wet | Very dark black
exercise: In brownish, what does the ending -ish mean? | Brown again | The end of a story | *A bit or rather | Very bright
exercise: «The rock was brownish-grey.» Which two colours are mixed in this rock? | Blue and green | Red and white | Yellow only | *Brown and grey
test: «The animals were sandy-yellow-brownish all over.» What does brownish mean in this sentence? | Very cold and icy | *A mix of brown with yellow and sandy shades | Bright purple | Covered in water
test: Which word is made by adding -ish to the colour brown? | browned | brownness | *brownish | brownly
exam: «A leaf is brownish-green.» Which colours are mixed in this leaf? | *Brown and green | Black and white | Pink and blue | Green only
